    "Aviso legal | Mirilla Inmobiliaria": "Legal notice | Mirilla Inmobiliaria",
    "Escríbenos para pedir visita a un inmueble, vender o alquilar tu piso o decirnos qué casa buscas. Te respondemos en un día laborable.": "Write to us to book a viewing, sell or let your home, or tell us what you're looking for. We reply within one working day.",
    "Para pedir visita, vender, alquilar o contarnos qué buscas. Si prefieres hablar, llámanos.": "To book a viewing, sell, let or tell us what you're looking for. If you'd rather talk, call us.",
